    <briefdescription>
<para>Iterator to traverse all successors of a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_v_p_block_base" kindref="compound">VPBlockBase</ref> node. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This includes the entry node of VPRegionBlocks. Exit blocks of a region implicitly have their parent region&apos;s successors. This ensures all blocks in a region are visited before any blocks in a successor region when doing a reverse post-order </para>
    </detaileddescription>
